{"audio":{"src":"https://pub-13abeb101e2945d2a7f60234f6faf52e.r2.dev/materials/a2-explainer-about-elden-ring-the-game-and-its-creation-write-like-you-are-talking-to-expl/audio/main-1aadbb658119.mp3","durationSec":197.208,"cues":[{"start":0,"end":2.8,"text":"Elden Ring is a 2022 action RPG."},{"start":3.68,"end":9.4,"text":"In this kind of game, you control a character, explore, fight, and become stronger."},{"start":9.4,"end":13.48,"text":"FromSoftware, a Tokyo game studio, led its creation."},{"start":14.34,"end":19.44,"text":"Bandai Namco published the game outside Japan, while FromSoftware published it in Japan."},{"start":20.34,"end":24.62,"text":"Hidetaka Miyazaki, the director of Elden Ring, directed the project."},{"start":25.32,"end":28.44,"text":"The game first came out on 25 February 2022."},{"start":29.08,"end":37.84,"text":"People could play it on PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Windows, Xbox One, and Xbox Series X/S."},{"start":37.84,"end":40.94,"text":"The Lands Between is the world of Elden Ring."},{"start":41.62,"end":46.5,"text":"It is an open world, so players have a lot of room to wander and choose where to go."},{"start":47.1,"end":50.7,"text":"You play as a Tarnished, the kind of character the player is."},{"start":51.26,"end":57.46,"text":"This character is an exile who is called back to repair the Elden Ring and become Elden Lord."},{"start":58.38,"end":61.6,"text":"Travel is important because the world is very large."},{"start":61.6,"end":63.52,"text":"You can ride a horse named Torrent."},{"start":64.24,"end":67.74,"text":"You also meet enemies and fight them with different weapons or with magic."},{"start":69.02,"end":73.56,"text":"The game’s roots reach back to Demon's Souls, an earlier game that started this style."},{"start":74.26,"end":77.86,"text":"It came out in 2009 and made hard fights and death part of learning."},{"start":78.94,"end":83.3,"text":"Dark Souls, an earlier FromSoftware hard action game, followed in 2011."},{"start":84.08,"end":88.42,"text":"Its areas used narrower paths, and players had to put parts of the story together."},{"start":88.42,"end":95.36,"text":"Production of Elden Ring began in early 2017, after work on extra content for Dark Souls III."},{"start":96.24,"end":101.6,"text":"The studio wanted to keep this difficult style but place it in a bigger open world with more freedom to wander."},{"start":102.52,"end":107.26,"text":"Hidetaka Miyazaki joined FromSoftware in 2004, when he was 29."},{"start":107.8,"end":109.2,"text":"He first worked as a game planner."},{"start":109.88,"end":114.48,"text":"Later, he took over Demon's Souls when the project was in trouble and helped shape the finished game."},{"start":115.11,"end":119.44,"text":"He then directed Dark Souls and became president of FromSoftware in 2014."},{"start":120.78,"end":125.1,"text":"In his games, the story often does not arrive through many long movie scenes."},{"start":125.92,"end":129.74,"text":"Players find parts of it in short item texts and in the places they visit."},{"start":130.58,"end":134.94,"text":"This style asks players to look carefully and connect small pieces of information."},{"start":136.28,"end":136.66,"text":"George R."},{"start":136.66,"end":136.88,"text":"R."},{"start":136.88,"end":140.68,"text":"Martin, the writer of the mythic background for the world, had a special job."},{"start":141.5,"end":144.86,"text":"Hidetaka Miyazaki asked him to create the old background of the world."},{"start":145.54,"end":148.56,"text":"This gave the team a history behind the people and events in the game."},{"start":149.28,"end":152.74,"text":"However, Martin did not design the fights or the open world."},{"start":153.46,"end":156.28,"text":"He also did not write the item texts that players read."},{"start":156.28,"end":158.82,"text":"FromSoftware built the game and its play."},{"start":159.66,"end":163.56,"text":"Miyazaki stayed the lead writer for the story that players meet during their journey."},{"start":164.68,"end":170.28,"text":"Elden Ring was shown to the public at E3 in June 2019 and was released in February 2022."},{"start":170.84,"end":173.62,"text":"Later that year, it received major prizes."},{"start":174.64,"end":178.4,"text":"The Game Awards is a yearly show that names the year’s best games."},{"start":179.2,"end":182.96,"text":"On 8 December 2022, Elden Ring won Game of the Year there."},{"start":183.52,"end":188.38,"text":"It also won Best Game Direction, Best Art Direction, and Best Role Playing Game that night."},{"start":189.22,"end":191.38,"text":"Its audience continued to grow after release."},{"start":192.4,"end":196.56,"text":"By April 2025, the game had sold more than 30 million copies."}],"words":[{"text":"Elden","start":0,"end":0.4},{"text":"Ring","start":0.4,"end":0.6},{"text":"is","start":0.6,"end":0.82},{"text":"a","start":0.82,"end":0.96},{"text":"2022","start":0.96,"end":1.58},{"text":"action","start":1.58,"end":2.24},{"text":"RPG","start":2.24,"end":2.8},{"text":"In","start":3.68,"end":3.78},{"text":"this","start":3.78,"end":3.98},{"text":"kind","start":3.98,"end":4.2},{"text":"of","start":4.2,"end":4.4},{"text":"game","start":4.4,"end":4.64},{"text":"you","start":5.14,"end":5.16},{"text":"control","start":5.16,"end":5.52},{"text":"a","start":5.52,"end":5.74},{"text":"character","start":5.74,"end":6.16},{"text":"explore","start":6.72,"end":7.22},{"text":"fight","start":7.72,"end":8},{"text":"and","start":8.48,"end":8.6},{"text":"become","start":8.6,"end":8.86},{"text":"stronger","start":8.86,"end":9.4},{"text":"FromSoftware","start":9.4,"end":11.04},{"text":"a","start":11.04,"end":11.12},{"text":"Tokyo","start":11.12,"end":11.46},{"text":"game","start":11.46,"end":11.68},{"text":"studio","start":11.68,"end":12.18},{"text":"led","start":12.58,"end":12.76},{"text":"its","start":12.76,"end":12.98},{"text":"creation","start":12.98,"end":13.48},{"text":"Bandai","start":14.34,"end":14.58},{"text":"Namco","start":14.58,"end":15.08},{"text":